                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "\ud83d\udce3 We\u2019re bringing our office to you in Balch Springs Sat, Aug 9th, from 11 AM - 1 PM to help with federal casework like:\n\n\u2714\ufe0f Social Security\n\u2714\ufe0f Medicare\n\u2714\ufe0f Veterans benefits\n\u2714\ufe0f Immigration\n\nAnd more! Come get help\u2014no appointment needed. \n\n#tx32 #officehours #congressonyourcorner https://t.co/TtAEkJQmBM",
